<title>PERU: Peru's Morococha Q1 net 4.0 mln soles. [CORRECTED 15:53 GMT]</title>
<headline>Peru's Morococha Q1 net 4.0 mln soles. [CORRECTED 15:53 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 4.0 million soles vs 2.4 million soles</p>
<p>Revs 30.6 million soles vs 23.7 million soles</p>
<p>NOTE: Compania Minera San Ignacio de Morococha SA is a polymetallic miner.</p>
<p>(Corrects 1996 net figure to profit, instead of loss)</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
